<title>GERMANY: Transrapid construction to go out to open bidding.</title>
<headline>Transrapid construction to go out to open bidding.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>German transportation Minister Matthias Wissmann said on Friday that the departure of the building firms from the Transrapid rail project would result in open bidding for the construction part of the project.</p>
<p>Wissmann was speaking at a news conference in Bonn about the future of the Transrapid project.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
